WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.300
Diffusion of innovations says new products spread through five groups:

00:00:01.054 --> 00:00:04.766
innovators,

00:00:04.816 --> 00:00:05.757
early adopters,

00:00:05.807 --> 00:00:06.841
the early majority,

00:00:06.891 --> 00:00:09.082
the late majority and laggards.

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:11.156
A new app lands.

00:00:11.206 --> 00:00:13.219
Innovators grab it for the novelty.

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:15.059
Early adopters show it off.

00:00:15.109 --> 00:00:19.525
The majority waits for proof, and laggards join only when they have to.

00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:21.409
To win the majority,

00:00:21.459 --> 00:00:25.287
make it easy to try and easy to see other people using it.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.141
Use it like this:

00:00:27.191 --> 00:00:28.639
find the group you have now,

00:00:28.689 --> 00:00:30.136
aim the message at the next one,

00:00:30.186 --> 00:00:32.510
and make trying it easy.
